{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0223_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ffe7f4810a99469271fc2618445512c76dc7f2236c730ac24fcc99e4528f82a1", "ja": "（今日は『765プロ　クッキング大運動会』の\nリハーサルだった。みんな気合いが入っていたな！）", "zh": "（今天是“765事务所烹饪大运动会”的彩排。大家都干劲十足啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0223_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "4a14d459199b0cd1de115bc2e0eefe75abd5abea493a5f61cc81db60de5ae715", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまー！\n自分の活躍、見てたよね？　ね！", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦！\n有看到我的表现吧？对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0223_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "db49cd23a500a7aefa3e68e4899cd52de7a5a19d9eeb02781604fe08645c53df", "ja": "今日はまだリハーサルだったけど、\n本番もこの調子で頑張るから、期待してて！", "zh": "今天虽然还只是彩排，\n但正式演出我也会保持这个状态加油的，期待着吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0223_1003_p", "source_sha256": "7f5a19b7229369fd4a1902860bc3f18f85d98f6d98a7fc1850364dd858a3b09e", "ja": "お疲れさま！　ずいぶん張り切ってるな。\n確かに、響向けのイベントだとは思ったけど……。", "zh": "辛苦了！你还真是干劲十足啊。  \n确实，我也觉得这是为响准备的活动，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0223_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "cb7e15acfcd3a97645e0dcfce651e240e2411f2dbc295e5ab0c7ffba12d5b023", "ja": "今回のテーマは、料理と運動だからね！\nこのふたつなら自分、大活躍間違いなしだぞ！", "zh": "这次的主题是料理和运动嘛！\n这两方面我肯定能大显身手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0223_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "37e327767c5b0309e5853287fb94e1d3a5f0098e1dd625a01ed4fba761801bf1", "ja": "料理のレパートリーも増やしてきたし……\n今から本番が待ち遠しいさー！", "zh": "菜谱的储备也增加了……\n现在就开始迫不及待期待正式演出了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0223_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7a5601eab0bf4d00cf7d838b11f0b762a4af9c6f7066ce8c01af6aeab2d69a17", "ja": "そうか。響の料理はおいしいから、\nどんな料理を作るか楽しみだな……。", "zh": "这样啊。因为响做的料理很好吃，\n真期待她这次会做什么菜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0223_1007_se", "source_sha256": "78ee14e4164f356eec4c47f22d7a4bf810179a1eec2b930b2aa950f47ac1bcc1", "ja": "グウゥゥ……！", "zh": "咕呜呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0223_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "24a1ee3564feef7e0ad517e4a06aa6b7256bab0abf3355d8f28afeed99b5580a", "ja": "えっ、なに今の！？　ライオンのうなり声……？", "zh": "诶，刚才那是什么！？狮子的吼声……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0223_1009_p", "source_sha256": "47ffe5c2f2768a440558cd02a32e577700b57f53d4163780beb324a7b59391f7", "ja": "ご、ごめん！　お腹が鳴って……。\nそういえば、朝からなにも食べてなかったからな。", "zh": "对、对不起！是肚子叫了……\n说起来，我从早上开始就什么都没吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0223_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "8ef4a0f2cc3de8f10de1b09b929bf919b0085f8236e712fa33f06796485f2aba", "ja": "ええっ！？　今のが……？　でもそっか。\n{$P$}、お腹減ってるんだ。", "zh": "诶！？刚才那个就是……？不过这样啊。\n{$P$}肚子饿了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0223_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "f63cbc5c7fc8010064615e0fb67746815f9fc7f41d1d3052e73f28c4f93e96d7", "ja": "それなら、帰ったら自分、何か作ってあげるさー！", "zh": "那样的话，回去后我给你做点什么吃吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0223_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3d32760b6827d55451ccd367cec07cf51d27d5d42eb590fc941783b41b39bc98", "ja": "えっ？　でも……。", "zh": "咦？可是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0223_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "ddb2dc6bed5220f584be81e63690327e3179d1de5ae6f0f2165f8f83d4675ef6", "ja": "遠慮なんかいらないぞ！　自分のご飯も、\nいぬ美たちのご飯も一緒に作らなきゃだし……。", "zh": "不用客气！还得一起做我和伊努美它们的饭……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0223_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "daa11134ade5a783e17e86ad5cce62602a7c133e2e08e8f6008c2f2c1c2af361", "ja": "一人分増えても、手間は変わらないさー。\nあっ、でも食材の買い出しは手伝ってもらうけどね！", "zh": "就算多做一人份，工夫也不会增加啦——\n啊，不过买食材的时候要帮我一起去哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0223_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0fe39d01f315907c91927c073bdec6fddf930186091c94d7de2b7e82e613b219", "ja": "それくらい、お安い御用だよ。\nありがとう、響。", "zh": "这点小事，完全不在话下。\n谢谢你，响。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0223_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "f06466372c171531d6461d2334bd5693659ae3d28509037ed32168cc36fb76b8", "ja": "ううん！　新しい料理の試食もしてほしいし……その\n代わり、感想よろしくね、{$P$}♪", "zh": "不客气！我也想让你尝尝新做的菜……作为\n交换，感想就拜托你啰，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
